==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|inglōriōsus}}.<ref name="OED">{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=8696415327}}</ref> {{surf|en|in-<id:inverse>|glorious}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈɡlɔɹi.əs/|/ɪnˈɡloʊɹi.əs/}}
